{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q100","title":"Willis動脈環的囊狀動脈瘤：血流向哪一層？","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"16e4f76cbb872d47980409484debe0783401c7e65a55f338ff642c46e3a13110","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_5a01acfb690c8191b3796bc453f98a37","sourceAnchor":"q100","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>D</strong>。腦底動脈環旁可見明顯的囊袋狀膨出，符合<strong>囊狀動脈瘤（saccular／berry aneurysm）</strong>的形態。這類動脈瘤一旦破裂，血液可流入腦表面的<strong>蜘蛛膜下腔</strong>，造成自發性蜘蛛膜下腔出血。</p>","html":"<div><h2>Willis動脈環的囊狀動脈瘤：血流向哪一層？</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><h3>官方標本顯示動脈瘤，破裂後可造成蜘蛛膜下腔出血</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>D</strong>。腦底動脈環旁可見明顯的囊袋狀膨出，符合<strong>囊狀動脈瘤（saccular／berry aneurysm）</strong>的形態。這類動脈瘤一旦破裂，血液可流入腦表面的<strong>蜘蛛膜下腔</strong>，造成自發性蜘蛛膜下腔出血。</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:497px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.8568965517241379\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/a89eb4c924cbc3247e3ebc9225128b8998822e79adb267f86ed351d9c23ea75b.jpg\" alt=\"第100題完整腦底血管標本原圖，大型囊狀病變位於圖左，原左上小箭頭保留\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"497\" height=\"580\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/a89eb4c924cbc3247e3ebc9225128b8998822e79adb267f86ed351d9c23ea75b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>考題原圖：</strong>圖左有顯著囊狀膨出，原小箭頭與全部血管邊緣保留。原圖解析度與方向資訊有限，足以辨認動脈瘤，不據此硬指定其確切分支或破裂點。來源：考選部本題公開試卷。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1200px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.6352567496029645\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/b3290901c9844447951e1e7b00e7ac4909555986c810425d77839905d617f0d0.png\" alt=\"Willis動脈環正常標名圖，前交通、前大腦、頸內、後交通、後大腦與基底動脈的連接\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1889\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/b3290901c9844447951e1e7b00e7ac4909555986c810425d77839905d617f0d0.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>正常血管連接：</strong>前交通動脈連接兩側前大腦動脈；後交通動脈連接頸內動脈系統與後大腦動脈。囊狀動脈瘤常發生於腦底動脈分叉附近。圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Circle_of_Willis_en.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rhcastilhos</a>；<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Circle_of_Willis_en.svg#Licensing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">作者釋出公有領域</a>。完整原向量圖轉為顯示圖，無裁切。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>動脈瘤是血管壁的局部膨出，不是腦組織長出腫瘤。</strong>常見相關因子包括吸菸、高血壓及特定家族／遺傳背景。未破裂者可能無症狀；破裂時典型為突然、劇烈的雷擊樣頭痛，可伴噁心、頸部僵硬、意識改變或神經缺損。</p>\n<h3>血為何進入蜘蛛膜下腔？先看腦膜層次</h3>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1200px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5404364569961488\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d3fe9a1bfd381104cf1aec09994ae80144f344a42b68459fcb48fab6677eedff.png\" alt=\"腦膜剖面，硬腦膜外層、蜘蛛膜跨越腦溝、軟腦膜貼腦表面，兩者之間為含血管及腦脊髓液的蜘蛛膜下腔\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"779\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d3fe9a1bfd381104cf1aec09994ae80144f344a42b68459fcb48fab6677eedff.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>由外向內辨認<strong>Dura mater（硬腦膜）→Arachnoid（蜘蛛膜）→Pia mater（軟腦膜）</strong>。蜘蛛膜跨過腦溝，軟腦膜緊貼腦表面；兩者間含小樑的空間為蜘蛛膜下腔，容納腦脊髓液與表面血管。圖中紅色小圓血管即位於此層次。圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Meninges-en.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mysid／SEER Development Team／Jmarchn</a>；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h3>用腦膜層次，一起整理顱內出血</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>出血位置</th><th>常考來源／機轉</th><th>典型影像或分布</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>硬腦膜外</strong></td><td>常與外傷及中腦膜動脈損傷相關</td><td>典型雙凸透鏡狀血腫</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>硬腦膜下</strong></td><td>常與橋靜脈破裂相關</td><td>典型新月形血腫</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>蜘蛛膜下腔</strong></td><td>本題為囊狀動脈瘤破裂；外傷亦可造成</td><td>血液沿腦溝、腦池分布</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>腦實質內</strong></td><td>高血壓小血管病、腦類澱粉血管病等</td><td>血腫位於腦組織內，位置依病因不同</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>A的失智、B的步態不穩／共濟失調、C的舞蹈症各可有不同神經系統病因，均不如D直接對應此囊狀動脈瘤。動脈瘤性蜘蛛膜下腔出血的重要併發症還包括<strong>再出血、水腦症與延遲性腦缺血</strong>；突然劇烈頭痛需緊急評估。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第100題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ninds.nih.gov/health-information/disorders/cerebral-aneurysms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NINDS：腦動脈瘤與破裂表現</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK588910/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NICE：動脈瘤性蜘蛛膜下腔出血</a></li><li><a href=\"https://professional.heart.org/en/science-news/2023-guideline-for-the-management-of-patients-with-aneurysmal-subarachnoid-hemorrhage/top-things-to-know\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AHA/ASA 2023：出血後重要併發症</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Circle_of_Willis_en.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rhcastilhos：Willis動脈環完整圖</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Meninges-en.svg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mysid等：腦膜層次完整圖</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":3,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}